        {
          "text": "Nukw ivyagezwe n’ibiki? Vyageretsweko kubg’ ibicumuro, ngo bigumeho kugeza ah’ uruvyaro ruzozira rwasezeranywe ivy’ isezerano: kandi vyahawe abamarayika kubigera, na bo babiha umushikirwa w’amajambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
